{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026K4rsaX3nZK1792989795.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中共二十屆五中全會，一連四天在北京舉行。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BJ.MEETING-1200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PIO3B7ShbV1792989792.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>相信是開幕會場的海淀區京西賓館，外圍有不少公安及交警戒備，普通車輛未能駛進該區域。附近一帶亦保安嚴密，多個路口設有路障，並有警員駐守。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BJ.MEETING-1200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026gr5oot8V9w1792989787.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>央視報道，會議的主要議程是中共中央政治局向中央委員會報告工作，研究持之以恆推進全面從嚴治黨若干重大問題。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:19.505786+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:58:15.093133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:08.399489+00:00","content_hash":"7685ef0e27cef4c7bfbaec16d68e76e1ba01bc25cc44481ac92dac2bd89eb657","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:19.505786+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}